    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20974" root="سنم" body-key="s">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنِمَ</span></b> , (M, Msb, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَمَ</span></b> , (Msb, K,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَمٌ</span>; (M, Msb;) so some say; others saying
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُنِمَ</span>, in the pass. form; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْنَمَ</span></b> , as some say;
others saying ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْنِمَ</span></b> ; (Msb;) <i>He</i> (a camel) <i>was,</i>
or <i>became, large in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَام</span> [or <i>hump</i>]. (M,
Msb, K.)

